# Bypass tunnel portal (back layer, no outlines): a concrete face i/m with
# m formwork joints, an m arch ring with a d reveal round the transparent
# mouth (x 0..15, rows 16..47 + the pointed top), and a wing wall sloping
# from the terrace height (y 2) down to the road (x 63), meadow g/G
# hanging over its top edge, a d/m footing. Place it at col 105 with
# dx 8 (left edge = col 104): x 0..15 lies under the Alm's meadow and
# tunnel_bg tiles (the mouth), so the jamb and the slope show in cols
# 105..107. The slope is never flush with the terrace (D-038).
sprite = tunnelportal
size   = 64x48
origin = 32,48
anim   = idle frames=1
